\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0    Those with a desire to begin
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 A successful married life,
\par And desire to avert problems,
\par And a life of distress too,
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par May they begin in prayer,
\par Whereby they'll have a good start,
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj And the Lord will have them prepared!
\par \pard     For a life of tranquility.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.\cf0  With good discourses and advice,
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 And daily pray'r beginning;
\par They will have begun the union,
\par As is befitting Christians.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Then the reality shall dawn,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 That the Lord doth unite them,
\par And that He has shed his blessings
\par Upon the two married persons.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3.  Honour, happiness and others,
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 Are comprised in God's blessing,
\par They that tread the path of Jesus,
\par Shall receive eternal life.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par If it is decreed by God,
\par It shall be a good marriage,
\par And the two that came together,
\par Shall have peace here and thereafter.\f1 
\par \pard\cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

